  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Protection of Basic Services Program Phase II Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objective of the Ethiopia Protection of Basic Services Program Phase II Project (PBS II) is to contribute to expanding access and improving the quality of basic services in education, health, agriculture, water supply and sanitation, and rural roads delivered by sub-national governments, while continuing to deepen transparency and local accountability in service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
